            "paragraph": "In addition to local high-pressure dynamics, remote climate drivers such as the El Ni\u00f1o-Southern Oscillation (ENSO), Indian Ocean Dipole (IOD), and Southern Annular Mode (SAM) interact with the IOHP system to produce complex climate outcomes. For instance, El Ni\u00f1o phases often suppress convection over the eastern Indian Ocean, modulating the strength of the subtropical high and its impact on heat fluxes (Stuecker et al., 2013; Lim et al., 2016).",
